          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack that targets the closest eligible target, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If the target of that attack is within range of an objective marker your opponent controls, you can re-roll the Hit roll instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="dcc76c62" name="Patrol Squads" typeId="a915f3e9" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">At the start of the Declare Battle Formations step, before any units have been set up, this unit can be split into two units, each containing three models. If you do so, each of those units must contain one model equipped with a scatter laser.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
